=== INTERPRETER ===

This is the Interpreter directory. External dependencies approved here need to be carefully managed & approved.
Core <-- Interpreter <-- Scripts where 'a <-- b' means 'b depends (or can depend) upon a.'

The 'Interpreter' is responsible for managing the FPGA's on-fabric components be it through:
- 'Hardware scheduling capabilities'
- Generating components
- Performing analysis on waveforms to make decisions
etc.
